See `Production/docs/BEATGEN_NEW_EVENT_CHECKLIST.md` — code heals prompts; it does not register Kling Elements.

## Deploy gates (ground truth)

| Gate | Covers |
|------|--------|
| **`verify_tooling_dropbox_parity.py`** | Tooling repo SHA256 = Dropbox runtime for critical Python (fail = “fixed in git only”) |
| `post_tooling_change_smoke.sh` | pytest + rsync + parity + restart + HTTP smoke (full Python deploy loop) |
| `verify_o3_intro_contract.sh` | O3 sidecar contract, locks, still insert, voice bind |
| `verify_storyboard_session_durability.sh` | Prompt shape pytest + scope/library guards |
| `smoke_kling_canonical_prompt_shape_live.sh` | Live Event_2 intro **and** resolution V2 lint |

## Do not regress

- Pose re-register must not change `kling_voice_id` (see `kling-voice-bind-guardrails.mdc`)
- User framing in prompt box must survive submit for Element-bound beats (closeup / medium shot / head and torso keywords)
- `_migrate_sidecar` must not redirect locked library char refs when file still exists
